lippitude:
中：[医] 睑缘炎
英：n. Soreness of eyes; the state of being blear-eyed;
   blearedness.

litheness:
中：a. 轻盈的（等于lithesome）；柔软的；易弯曲的 (lithe的变形)
英：n. The quality or state of being lithe; flexibility;
   limberness.

lucchese:
中：n. (Lucchese)人名；(意)卢凯塞
英：n. sing. & pl. A native or inhabitant of Lucca, in Tuscany;
   in the plural, the people of Lucca.
